<title>USA: FCC approves Hearst-Argyle TV combination.</title>
<headline>FCC approves Hearst-Argyle TV combination.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argyle Television Inc said Thursday the Federal Communications Commission approved the pending combination of Argyle and the privately held Hearst Corp's television broadcast group.</p>
<p>Argyle said it expected the deal to close at the end of August.</p>
<p>The company first announced the transaction, which will form a new company called Hearst-Argyle Television Inc, March 26.</p>
